---
import { periodicImageTeachingError } from '../../../data/part04/ch13TeachingModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch13-supercell-images';
const defaults = { cellLength: 8, decayLength: 2 };
const initialError = periodicImageTeachingError(defaults);
---

<figure class="chapter-visual supercell-explorer" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：超胞长度与周期镜像误差</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: supercell length and periodic-image error</span>
  </figcaption>

  <label class="supercell-explorer__control">
    <span>超胞长度 L（无量纲）| Supercell length L</span>
    <input data-cell-length type="range" min="4" max="20" step="1" value={defaults.cellLength} />
    <output data-cell-length-output>{defaults.cellLength}</output>
  </label>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 720 250" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>Repeated localized objects in periodic supercells</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>Three repeated cells contain identical localized objects. The cell width changes with the control and the displayed overlap tails become smaller as images separate.</desc>
    <line class="supercell-explorer__axis" x1="30" y1="190" x2="690" y2="190" />
    <g data-cell-left>
      <rect data-cell-rect x="50" y="42" width="180" height="148" class="supercell-explorer__cell" />
      <circle data-object cx="140" cy="132" r="22" class="supercell-explorer__object" />
      <path data-tail d="M85 132 C105 92 175 92 195 132 C175 172 105 172 85 132" class="supercell-explorer__tail" />
    </g>
    <g data-cell-centre>
      <rect data-cell-rect x="270" y="42" width="180" height="148" class="supercell-explorer__cell supercell-explorer__cell--primary" />
      <circle data-object cx="360" cy="132" r="22" class="supercell-explorer__object" />
      <path data-tail d="M305 132 C325 92 395 92 415 132 C395 172 325 172 305 132" class="supercell-explorer__tail" />
    </g>
    <g data-cell-right>
      <rect data-cell-rect x="490" y="42" width="180" height="148" class="supercell-explorer__cell" />
      <circle data-object cx="580" cy="132" r="22" class="supercell-explorer__object" />
      <path data-tail d="M525 132 C545 92 615 92 635 132 C615 172 545 172 525 132" class="supercell-explorer__tail" />
    </g>
    <text x="360" y="225" text-anchor="middle">periodic direction / 周期方向</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>归一化镜像误差 | normalized image error:</span>
    <strong data-image-error>{initialError.toExponential(3)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>局域对象的镜像耦合假设按 <code>exp(−L/ξ)</code> 衰减，固定 <code>ξ=2</code>。L 和误差均无量纲；SVG 只示意重复边界。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> image coupling of a localized object is assumed to decay as <code>exp(−L/ξ)</code> with fixed <code>ξ=2</code>. L and the error are dimensionless; the SVG only illustrates repeated boundaries.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>L 每增加 ξ，误差必须乘以 <code>e^(−1)</code>；整个允许区间中误差严格单调下降。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> increasing L by ξ must multiply the error by <code>e^(−1)</code>, and the error must decrease strictly across the allowed range.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该指数律只代表短程局域尾部。带电缺陷、偶极层、弹性场和金属 Friedel 型响应可呈代数或形状依赖，不能用本模型外推。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the exponential law represents a short-range localized tail only. Charged defects, dipole layers, elastic fields, and metallic Friedel-like response can be algebraic or shape dependent and cannot be extrapolated with this model.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript><p>关闭 JavaScript 后显示 L=8、ξ=2 的静态重复单元，归一化误差为 exp(−4)。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { periodicImageTeachingError } from '../../../data/part04/ch13TeachingModels.mjs';

  const root = document.getElementById('ch13-supercell-images');
  if (root) {
    const input = root.querySelector('[data-cell-length]');
    const output = root.querySelector('[data-cell-length-output]');
    const errorOutput = root.querySelector('[data-image-error]');
    const tails = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-tail]'));
    if (
      input instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && output instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && errorOutput instanceof HTMLElement
    ) {
      const update = () => {
        const cellLength = Number(input.value);
        const error = periodicImageTeachingError({ cellLength, decayLength: 2 });
        output.value = cellLength.toFixed(0);
        errorOutput.textContent = error.toExponential(3);
        tails.forEach((tail) => {
          if (tail instanceof SVGPathElement) tail.style.opacity = String(Math.max(0.08, Math.min(0.8, 7 * error)));
        });
      };
      input.addEventListener('input', update);
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .supercell-explorer__control {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .supercell-explorer input,
  .supercell-explorer svg {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .supercell-explorer svg text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .supercell-explorer__axis {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .supercell-explorer__cell {
    fill: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }

  .supercell-explorer__cell--primary {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 2.4;
  }

  .supercell-explorer__object {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .supercell-explorer__tail {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 2;
    opacity: 0.13;
  }
</style>
